[2026-09-21 14:47:59 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 068]   step_068: Wall vs distributed field -- the structure of the implied
[2026-09-21 14:47:59 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 068]   proper-time slip.
[2026-09-21 14:47:59 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 068]   Step_065 expressed the transit anomaly in time units (dtau).  Two
[2026-09-21 14:47:59 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 068]   physically distinct field geometries produce the same cap-localized
[2026-09-21 14:47:59 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 068]   excess and must be separated on the measured scaling:
[2026-09-21 14:47:59 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 068]   * a localized wall or thin boundary, crossed once: the phase slip is
[2026-09-21 14:47:59 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 068]   applied at the crossing instant, so dtau is independent of the
[2026-09-21 14:47:59 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 068]   time the comet spends inside the 250 AU sphere (log-log slope
[2026-09-21 14:47:59 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 068]   b ~= 0 of dtau vs t_transit);
[2026-09-21 14:47:59 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 068]   * a distributed lapse gradient filling the interior: the slip
[2026-09-21 14:47:59 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 068]   accumulates at a steady rate, so dtau ~ t_transit (b ~= 1).
[2026-09-21 14:47:59 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 068]   Both readings are TEP-compatible (Section 6.8 keeps both open); they
[2026-09-21 14:47:59 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 068]   are separated here by the measured exponent, by the variance reduction
[2026-09-21 14:47:59 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 068]   of the fractional slip, and by the inbound/outbound localization of
[2026-09-21 14:47:59 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 068]   the Warsaw channel.
[2026-09-21 14:47:59 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 068]   Additional coherence checks reported:
[2026-09-21 14:47:59 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 068]   * signed omega change dw = w_fut - w_orig for the CODE cohort --
[2026-09-21 14:47:59 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 068]   whether the in-cap rotation has a preferred handedness;
[2026-09-21 14:47:59 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 068]   * within-Warsaw correlation of the inbound slip with the full
[2026-09-21 14:47:59 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 068]   orig->fut slip, in cap vs out -- same-crossing-event coupling;
[2026-09-21 14:47:59 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 068]   * in-cap flatness of dtau vs axis distance (wall plateau vs the
[2026-09-21 14:47:59 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 068]   1/b^2 profile a point mass must write).
